# The deploy failed on a 339 MB ProRes master in public/videos: Vercel's
# limit is 100 MB per file, and the CLI does NOT fall back to .gitignore —
# with no .vercelignore it uploads everything beside the app.
#
# Nothing below is referenced by src/. The site's films stream from
# media.caribnexusai.com, so public/videos is 403 MB of masters and
# intermediates that no page asks for.
public/videos/

# Source projects that live alongside the site and never ship with it:
# Remotion renders, their caches, and the raw brand material.
motion/
video/
assets/
WhatsApp CB/
